# Step 5: TIP — Task Instruction Pack

## Objective
Break blueprint into implementable tasks with dependencies.

## TIP Format
```yaml
tip_id: "TIP-{{number}}"
title: "{{title}}"
phase: "{{A|B|C|D|E}}"
depends_on: [{{dep_list}}]
estimated_minutes: {{minutes}}
acceptance:
  - "{{criterion_1}}"
  - "{{criterion_2}}"
files_touched:
  - "{{file_path}}"
```
